  "title": "Southern Raisin and Coconut Pie",
  "description": "A wonderfully rich custard pie, this one is made from oodles of delicious plumped raisins, shredded coconut and chopped nuts, spooned in a crust and baked within 35 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Jackie"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-12-25T19:20:12-05:00",
